
* Requirements
'-> run as this directory owner's user the script 'allow_access.sh'
    in order to make sure 'postgres' user has access to it

* Database creation
'-> run as 'postgres' in order:
  |-> ./create_role.sh
  |-> ./create_database.sh
  '-> ./create_admin.py

* Database remotion
'-> run as 'postgres' in order:
  |-> ./drop_database.sh
  '-> ./drop_role.sh
